# Optional Online Flash Free-Text Rephrase Layer (/api/rephrase)
# The game runs 100% deterministically offline with zero keys configured.
# Configure ONE of the three providers below to enable live Flash rephrasing for free-text questions:

# Option 1 (Recommended on Vercel, matches ordamor): Vercel AI Gateway
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# FLASH_MODEL=google/gemini-3.8-flash

# Option 2: Google Gemini API (OpenAI-compatible endpoint)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# FLASH_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash

# Option 3: Custom / Local OpenAI-compatible Gateway (e.g. local proxy or OpenRouter)
# FLASH_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3425/v1/chat/completions
# FLASH_API_KEY=
# FLASH_MODEL=google/gemini-3.8-flash
# FLASH_TIMEOUT_MS=3200
